<p>ALLAH O AKBAR..</p>

<p>SUB'HAANA RABBI UL AALA WA BE HAMDE'H.</p>

<p>QAD QUTELAL MURTUZA...**2.</p>

<p>HAIN JAHAN MEIN AAJ MATAM HYDER E KARRAR ASWS. KA.</p>

<p>SAR PE MOULA KE SITAM YEH AY QUDA JJH. KAISA HUA.</p>

<p>
1. HOKE ZAQMI MASJIDE</p>

<p>KOOFA SE AAYE HAIN ALI ASWS....**2.</p>

<p>THAAM KAR SAR MUZTARIB HAIN QALQ KA MUSHKILKUSHA.</p>

<p>2. SABKO SHABBAR ASWS. KE HAWALE.</p>

<p>KARTE HAIN MOULA ALI ASWS...**2.</p>

<p>FATIMA ZEHRA S.A. KA GHAR AB BAN GAYA MATAM SARAA..</p>

<p>3. KYA QAYAMAT AAYI HAIN </p>

<p>EKKEESWEEN(21wi) RAMZAN KO..**2.</p>

<p>
QAT QUTELAL MURTUZA ASWS. JIBREEL DETE HAIN SADA.</p>

<p>
4. ROTE HAIN HASNAIN O KULSOOM S.A. </p>

<p>AUR ZAINAB ASWS. ZAAR ZAAR..**2.</p>

<p>KARTE HAI FARYAAD SABSE MARGAYA BABA MERA.</p>

<p>
5. BAANT-TA THA ROTIYA'N </p>

<p>RAATO'N KO UTHKE SABKE GHAR...**2.</p>

<p>HAAYE BEWO'N KA YATEEMO'N KA SAHARA NA RAHA.</p>

<p>6. AB JANAZA JAA RAHA HAIN</p>

<p>HASHR HAIN HAR SOO BAPA...**2</p>

<p>AY SOHAIL IS GHAM SE HAIN MAGHMOOM KUFE KI FIZA.</p>

<p><center><h4>Kalaam: JANAB RAZA ALI SOHAIL SAHAB.</h4></center></p>
